oLXZ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19817, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01DfyUJeTGy7Tp8YhX28EWsx", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 20117, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01DfyUJeTGy7Tp8YhX28EWsx", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 20117, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01DfyUJeTGy7Tp8YhX28EWsx", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 24722, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01NBhU1HqGiNxJcVKYxt7tPg", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks, rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failed health checks in production after it was deployed to us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an error rate of 18%. The release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) had also been marked unhealthy in staging. Action taken: rolled back all regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving regions on mixed versions (us-east v2.3.0; us-west and eu-west v2.3.1). A second attempt finished in all regions. Current state: all three regions are on v2.3.0, the service is healthy and the error rate is 0.2%. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 regression; find out why v2.3.1 reached production after its RC failed in staging; look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55322, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01NBhU1HqGiNxJcVKYxt7tPg", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55322, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01NBhU1HqGiNxJcVKYxt7tPg", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 58022, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Cj2w5FRF4GcnSxjGFBS1ne", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 58322, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Cj2w5FRF4GcnSxjGFBS1ne", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 58322, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Cj2w5FRF4GcnSxjGFBS1ne", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 64095, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened the SEV2 incident.\n\n**Rollback**\n- v2.3.1 was failing health checks everywhere, with an 18% error rate. v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an error in the deployment system. That left us-east on v2.3.0 and us-west and eu-west still on v2.3.1.\n- I ran the rollback once more, and it finished in all regions. A status check now shows us-east, us-west and eu-west all on v2.3.0, with the error rate down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create the incident timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created anyway, so I didn't send it again. This avoids paging the on-call engineer twice.\n- The incident is **INC-0001** (SEV2, open). It describes the bad release, the rollback (including the attempt that stopped partway) and the current state.\n- It also lists three follow-ups:\n  - Find what broke in v2.3.1.\n  - Find out how v2.3.1 reached production when its release candidate had already failed in staging.\n  - Look into the deployment system error that stopped the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_017iHXFjb7TexqgYe8ZpT68N", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01UZRuhwZbXpRAZViyv5G5H7", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy production release is v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01CeF93VRgsoJ1QYP7wYzitL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01FKEr3UTEbgeMTv77p3vCRw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to a known-healthy version is safe to repeat, so I'll try once more.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01V9nJBm3hN3aKkNAwdt2N1q", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01J9WeFk88NPJfXg6pYioLXZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01DfyUJeTGy7Tp8YhX28EWsx", "